This directory holds downloaded source PDFs / DOCX / TXT files for the
Premise Public Library, ingested via `npm run seed-public-corpus`.

Files in this directory are NOT committed to the repo (see .gitignore).
The manifest in `scripts/public-library-manifest.ts` is the canonical
record of what's in the public library.

Workflow:
  1. Run a Perplexity prompt from docs/PUBLIC_CORPUS_SHOPPING_LIST.md.
  2. Download each report's PDF into this folder, naming it predictably
     (e.g. `bls-cex-2024.pdf`, `pew-mobile-fact-sheet-2024.pdf`).
  3. Add an entry to scripts/public-library-manifest.ts pointing at the
     local file plus its provenance metadata.
  4. Run `npm run seed-public-corpus`.
